<title>DENMARK: Tele Danmark share up 3.88 pct.</title>
<headline>Tele Danmark share up 3.88 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish telecommunications group Tele Danmark shares rose 3.88 percent or 13.36 crowns to 357.36 crowns by 1145 gmt on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Dealers said that the increase echoed rises in Wall Street and the strong dollar. -- Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
